Common ContentStandard
    documentation "An indication as to whether an assessment conforms to a standard (e.g., local standard, statewide standard, regional standard, association standard).
    ..."
    shared string ContentStandardTitle named Title
        documentation "The name of the content standard, for example Common Core."
        is required
    shared string Author
        documentation "The person or organization chiefly responsible for the intellectual content of the standard."
        is optional collection
    shared string ContentStandardVersion named Version
        documentation "The version identifier for the content."
        is optional
    shared string URI
        documentation "An unambiguous reference to the standards using a network-resolvable URI."
        is optional
    choice PublicationDateChoice
        documentation "The date or year that this content was first published."
        is optional
    descriptor PublicationStatus
        documentation "The publication status of the document (i.e., Adopted, Draft, Published, Deprecated, Unknown)."
        is optional
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation "Optionally relates the entity mandating the use of the content standard."
        is optional
        role name Mandating
    date BeginDate
        documentation "The beginning of the period during which this learning standard document is intended for use.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is optional
    date EndDate
        documentation "The end of the period during which this learning standard document is intended for use.  Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is optional
